The bug occurs because the `rx_rings` variable is incorrectly adjusted for aggregation (AGG) rings before calling the `_bnxt_get_max_rings()` function. This premature adjustment causes the function to check for twice the number of rings than required, leading to potential allocation failures when the actual maximum number of rings is exceeded.

